Phase 2: Seed data + Home feed (cards, chips, Shorts shelf, skeletons,
         hide-on-scroll top bar).
Phase 3: Watch page with custom player and related videos.
Phase 4: Mini player.
Phase 5: Likes, views, subscribe button, history, watch later.
Phase 6: Comments.
Phase 7: Shorts.
Phase 8: Search and notifications.
Phase 9: Upload video and upload Short.
Phase 10: You tab, settings, light/dark theme, final polish and
          a check against the animations checklist.

If something is ambiguous, ask me before writing code. When I paste an
error, explain the cause in one or two sentences before giving the fix.